          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Mystery Case Files: MillionHeir is a puzzle adventure video game developed by Big Fish Games and Griptonite Games and published by Nintendo,[1] for the Nintendo DS handheld video game console. It was first released in North America, was later released in Australia, and then Europe. It is the second Mystery Case Files game to be made for a portable device. Although the game is part of the Mystery Case Files brand, it is not a part of the main computer game series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mystery Case Files: MillionHeir es un videojuego de aventura de puzles desarrollado por Big Fish Games y Griptonite Games, y publicado por Nintendo,[1] para la consola portátil Nintendo DS. Se lanzó primero en Norteamérica, después en Australia y más tarde en Europa. Es el segundo juego de Mystery Case Files creado para un dispositivo portátil. Aunque forma parte de la marca Mystery Case Files, no pertenece a la serie principal de juegos para computadora.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
