        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Mystery Case Files: The Malgrave Incident is an puzzle adventure video game developed by Big Fish Games together with Sanzaru Games and published by Nintendo, for the Wii video game console. It was first released in North America on June 27, 2011. It was released in Europe on September 9, 2011. This is the third game in the series to be developed on a different platform and the second one to be published by Nintendo.[1]",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mystery Case Files: The Malgrave Incident es un videojuego de aventura de puzles desarrollado por Big Fish Games junto con Sanzaru Games y publicado por Nintendo para la consola Wii. Se lanzó primero en Norteamérica el 27 de junio de 2011 y en Europa el 9 de septiembre de 2011. Es el tercer juego de la serie desarrollado para una plataforma distinta y el segundo publicado por Nintendo.[1]",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
